@startuml
!include style.iuml
' Teacher exam wizard (Admin_Web_Panel pages/teacher/CreateExamPage.tsx, routes /teacher/create-exam and
' /teacher/exams/:examId/edit) and ExamsController.CreateExam / UpdateExam / ValidateExamPayloadAsync /
' RefuseOtherTeachersStudentsAsync (own sections or no section, else 403 STUDENT_NOT_IN_YOUR_SECTIONS) / MapQuestions.
' The save stages audit EXAM_CREATED (UpdateExam: EXAM_UPDATED) in the same SaveChanges.
' Sized for a full-width figure: dpi 96 with a large font (PlantUML gaps are fixed in pixels).
' Printed pt = fontSize * 72 * printed_width_in / png_width_px.
skinparam dpi 96
skinparam defaultFontSize 28
skinparam ArrowFontSize 27
skinparam padding 1
skinparam swimlane {
  BorderColor #777777
  TitleFontSize 29
}

|Web Panel (Teacher)|
start
:Open /teacher/create-exam
(edit: /teacher/exams/{id}/edit);
:1 Basic info: title, section,
date, start time, duration;
:2 Questions: MCQ (options,
correct answer), Theory,
Coding (public or hidden
test cases);
:3 Rules and settings: allowed
apps, lockdown mode, webcam,
mic, readiness, practice
exam, seat, capture intervals;
:4 Assign students (each
step checked before Next);
repeat
  :POST /api/exams
  (edit: PUT /api/exams/{id});
  |Server|
  :PUT only: 404 if no such exam,
  403 if not own section,
  409 if not Scheduled;
  :ValidateExamPayloadAsync:
  own section, at least one
  question, marks > 0, MCQ with
  2+ options, a test case per
  coding question, C/C++ only;
  :RefuseOtherTeachersStudentsAsync
  (Teacher role; PUT: added
  students only): students of own
  sections or of no section, else
  403 STUDENT_NOT_IN_YOUR_
  SECTIONS;
  |Web Panel (Teacher)|
  backward :Show the server
  message, fix the step;
  |Server|
repeat while (Payload and\naccess OK?) is ([no: 4xx]) not ([yes])
:Save Exam (Scheduled,
AllowedApps as JSON list),
Questions, TestCases,
ExamAssignments and the
audit row EXAM_CREATED (PUT:
EXAM_UPDATED) in one
SaveChanges; 201 Created
(PUT: 200 OK);
|Web Panel (Teacher)|
:Return to the dashboard;
stop
@enduml
